@YourCloset.API_HostAddress = http://localhost:5200

### 1. Obtener todos los clientes (GET)
GET http://localhost:5200/api/clientes
Accept: application/json

### 2. Crear un nuevo cliente (POST)
POST http://localhost:5200/api/clientes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombre": "Ana",
  "apellido": "García",
  "email": "ana@mail.com",
  "telefono": "555-1234",
  "direccion": "Calle Principal 123"
}

### 3. Obtener cliente por ID (GET)
GET http://localhost:5200/api/clientes/1
Accept: application/json

### 4. Actualizar cliente (PUT)
PUT http://localhost:5200/api/clientes/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombre": "Ana Actualizada",
  "apellido": "García López",
  "email": "ana.nueva@mail.com",
  "telefono": "555-9999",
  "direccion": "Nueva Dirección 456"
}

### 5. Eliminar cliente (DELETE)
DELETE http://localhost:5200/api/clientes/1


### ==========================================
### 👕 ENDPOINTS DE PRENDAS
### ==========================================

### 6. Obtener todas las prendas (GET)
GET http://localhost:5200/api/prendas
Accept: application/json
###
### 7. Obtener cliente por ID (Exitoso - 200 OK)
GET http://localhost:5200/api/clientes/1
Accept: application/json

### 8. Obtener cliente por ID (Fallido - 404 Not Found)
GET http://localhost:5200/api/clientes/999
Accept: application/json

### 9. Actualizar cliente (Exitoso - 204 No Content)
PUT http://localhost:5200/api/clientes/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombre": "Ana Actualizada",
  "apellido": "García López",
  "email": "ana.nueva@mail.com",
  "telefono": "555-9999",
  "direccion": "Nueva Dirección 456"
}

### 10. Eliminar cliente (Exitoso - 204 No Content)
DELETE http://localhost:5200/api/clientes/1

### 11. Obtener prenda por ID
GET http://localhost:5200/api/prendas/1
Accept: application/json

### 12. Actualizar prenda (PUT)
PUT http://localhost:5200/api/prendas/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombre": "Camisa Oxford Manga Larga",
  "categoria": "Camisa",
  "talla": "M",
  "color": "Azul",
  "precio": 29.99,
  "stock": 8
}

### 13. Eliminar prenda (DELETE)
DELETE http://localhost:5200/api/prendas/1

### 14. Obtener venta por ID
GET http://localhost:5200/api/ventas/1
Accept: application/json

### 15. Actualizar venta (PUT)
PUT http://localhost:5200/api/ventas/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "clienteId": 1,
  "prendaId": 1,
  "cantidad": 3,
  "total": 89.97
}

### 16. Eliminar venta (DELETE)
DELETE http://localhost:5200/api/ventas/1